                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f8c06bf3-c5d3-339f-ae27-2c554a7a9c50",
                        "entry_id": "97bd24ef-ddfa-3e07-8001-a6e22f1494dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Well maintained and fully stocked and equipped."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7611033-ca40-4481-8298-b238297ea71b",
                                "sense_id": "f8c06bf3-c5d3-339f-ae27-2c554a7a9c50",
                                "text": "To leave his kingdom well-found and strong—that is a King's work."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fe1322a-77a7-4029-9786-ef2efcd2fc41",
                                "sense_id": "f8c06bf3-c5d3-339f-ae27-2c554a7a9c50",
                                "text": "The Nicholas is a well-found ship, and with a nice clean hull."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "255e5376-0eaf-4ec1-8b1d-b0ef5e03da96",
                                "sense_id": "f8c06bf3-c5d3-339f-ae27-2c554a7a9c50",
                                "text": "We grieve to see paupers, and such like, arriving from abroad; but when we behold a body of intelligent and well-found emigrants like these, arrived on our shores, we rejoice to extend to them the honest hand of welcome."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a38a12c-ff58-4b7b-a2f3-6c18d369d747",
                                "sense_id": "f8c06bf3-c5d3-339f-ae27-2c554a7a9c50",
                                "text": "He said the 'ouse was well-found. Him with his well-found 'ouse! They're bound to give you what you need, but if you don't mind expense..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14f24815-be44-43bf-824a-4cc20ed1e645",
                                "sense_id": "f8c06bf3-c5d3-339f-ae27-2c554a7a9c50",
                                "text": "Although it is more burdensome to handle than a Bermudan rig, a well-found gaff rig copes with heavy weather at least as capably as its triangular equivalent."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b69d1f7-067b-3f16-94d2-2735ff3e22d7",
                        "entry_id": "97bd24ef-ddfa-3e07-8001-a6e22f1494dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Welcome; appreciated."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "be63bdf5-31f2-4a90-8461-b862020afd24",
                                "sense_id": "8b69d1f7-067b-3f16-94d2-2735ff3e22d7",
                                "text": "Having determin'd of the Vosces and To send for Titus Lartius, it remains, As the main point of this our after-meeting, To gratify his noble service that Hath thus stood for his country: therefore, Most reverend and grave elders, to desire please you, The present consul, and last general In our well-found successes, to report A little of the worthy work perform'd By Caius Marcius Coriolanus, whom We met here both to thank and to remember With honors like himself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f23d1f49-3d30-4ed5-8a5b-b52556d2b6f0",
                                "sense_id": "8b69d1f7-067b-3f16-94d2-2735ff3e22d7",
                                "text": "These stories, however, from their various sources appear to prove, so far as such mystic records can, that the Puans—Win-e-ba-goes—have a well-found antiquity at least."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4744ff12-ce4b-40f2-9071-39d4467e59b6",
                                "sense_id": "8b69d1f7-067b-3f16-94d2-2735ff3e22d7",
                                "text": "These contrast with a well-found orange in Elizabeth's drapery."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
